{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一行大号浅白标题最先入眼；下方紫色大句和第三行白色大字也很醒目，形成连续的多个视觉入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他在犹豫是否回去修复亲近关系，明知未必能找回来，却仍想再试一次。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"犹疑、期待、不甘心，带着不确定感。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他不愿只凭希望回去忍让；想先把眼下过稳，同时害怕独自承担、心里没底，却仍不打算放弃。底部小字还补充了问题未解但脚步已经开始向前的状态。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线\",\n    \"第三行大字包含稳定当下、害怕独自承担、仍不收回打算等多层意思\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c9281ae1-1274-4878-8e37-6b670d0ea9b4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T023445980615Z", "elapsed_seconds": 31.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:35:17.890939+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "15221859db81503d4c167e0f40bdea980e5be7a5dc00f3bd720c2525c9f33a7b", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f